nding Close.\\\",\\n    \\\"conditional_assessment\\\": \\\"An ordinary newly created, non-exempt transaction after Pending Close should be held rather than processed while the period remains Pending Close. Actual status consistency cannot be assessed without the event's type, created time, and accounting status.\\\",\\n    \\\"late_minutes_formula\\\": \\\"(event_created_time - pending_close_time) in seconds / 60\\\",\\n    \\\"timestamp_note\\\": \\\"Pending Close timestamp reproduced exactly as stored; no time-zone offset is supplied.\\\",\\n    \\\"policy_citation\\\": {\\n      \\\"source_file\\\": \\\"workspace/02_Cost_Accounting/oracle_supply_chain_cost_management_26b.pdf\\\",\\n      \\\"pdf_page\\\": 233,\\n      \\\"printed_page\\\": 225,\\n      \\\"section\\\": \\\"Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"read_only\\\": true,\\n    \\\"artifact_path\\\": \\\"/cache/work/worker_59f494765143/audit-report.json\\\",\\n    \\\"schema_limitation\\\": \\\"Null event-dependent fields intentionally preserve uncertainty instead of fabricating schema-conforming facts.\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"source_ids\\\": [\\\"r_bd741dd9b6ff1e4722ce0d73\\\"],\\n  \\\"source_provenance\\\": {\\n    \\\"resource_id\\\": \\\"r_bd741dd9b6ff1e4722ce0d73\\\",\\n    \\\"read_service\\\": \\\"resource_read\\\",\\n    \\\"read_status\\\": 200,\\n    \\\"source_payload_sha256\\\": \\\"77129c2275b1708302c90753b4f186a1e6de5e3649f76593bbda72f103869027\\\",\\n    \\\"actual_read_receipt_id\\\": \\\"r_b0b190239020ca7287b6da9e\\\",\\n    \\\"database_source_file\\\": \\\"system/oracle_scm_cost_management/state.db\\\",\\n    \\\"work_order_evidence\\\": {\\\"table\\\": \\\"work_orders\\\", \\\"key\\\": \\\"WO-2025-09-004\\\"},\\n    \\\"period_evidence\\\": {\\\"table\\\": \\\"cost_periods\\\", \\\"key\\\": \\\"PER-COST-2025-09\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"PENDING_CLOSE\\\"},\\n    \\\"policy_evidence_location\\\": \\\"answer.policy_citation\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"serv